The Canvas2D passive-tree renderer in this directory (viewport.ts, spatialIndex.ts, lod.ts,
arc.ts, and the structure of nodeVisual.ts / draw.ts / TreeCanvas.tsx) is ported and adapted
from the `src/render/` module of:

    poe2-build-planner  --  https://github.com/poe2-tools/poe2-build-planner

Its source code is MIT-licensed. GitHub reports "NOASSERTION" only because the upstream LICENSE
file appends a game-data carve-out note; the code licence itself is plain MIT.

