What was taken: the renderer maths and structure only. What was NOT taken: upstream's bundled
tree data, sprite atlases, DDS/PNG art, and their GGG-schema tree loader (`src/tree/`). Those
are Grinding Gear Games property, explicitly excluded from the MIT grant. This port draws plain
shapes onto our own PoB-derived `tree-0_5.min.json` and carries none of that content.
